AnnotatedEquations
Copyright 2026 Bennett Landman

The renderer and teaching conventions were adapted from Bennett Landman's
ES 1400 course-book annotated equation system (tools/ann_eq.py and
docs/equation-style-guide.md). The bundled book examples preserve their
source figure IDs and provenance. This repository contains no course
transcripts or original slide decks.

Matplotlib and its bundled fonts retain their respective licenses.
Dependencies are installed separately.
